 "title": "Home | VanTilburg Farms",
 "text": "-->\nHome | VanTilburg Farms\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nVanTilburg Farms\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Businesses\nServices\nCrop Insurance\nGrain Services\nAg Retail & Services\nExcavation\nWeather\nCareers\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n​\nWelcome to VanTilburg Farms\nFARMING FOR THE FUTURE\nAt VanTilburg Farms we are committed to farming for a sustainable future. We utilize farming practices that are not only sustainable, but actually regenerative to our land and natural resources. By implementing cover crops, no-till farming and other regenerative farming methods, we are making a real impact on the health of our environment for future generations.\nLearn More\nFAQs (Frequently asked questions)\nAbout VanTilburg Farms\nGrain, Crops, and Farm Support\nCareers and Equipment Roles\nWho is VanTilburg Farms?\nVanTilburg Farms is a 4th-generation farming family based in Celina, Ohio where we have been farming for over 100 years. We focus on regenerative agricultural practices and provide a wide range of agricultural services to other farmers.\nWhat kind of farming approach does VanTilburg Farms use?\nVanTilburg Farms emphasizes regenerative agricultural practices. You can find highlights of farming practices and agricultural services as part of their work throughout our website.\nDo you work with other farmers or only your own operation?\nVanTilburg Farms offers a wide variety of agricultural services to other farmers. If you need a specific service, their site sections on grain, farming practices, and services are the best place to start.\nHow Can We Help You?\nOur roots are in farming, but we have diversified our business over the years to offer a wide variety of services to our community. Let us help you with all your farming or agricultural retail needs, excavation work or visit us at MVP Dairy.\nGrain Services & Crop Insurance\nWith ever-changing farm challenges, it’s essential to have expertise and experience on-hand. VanTilburg Farms will help sell or store your grain with confidence and protect your crops from potential losses throughout the year.\nLearn More\nAg Retail & Services\nLooking for complete agriculture solutions with proven practices and industry leading technology? VTF Sunrise offers a full range of ag services including crop protection products, nutrients, seeds and custom service.\nLearn More\nExcavation Services\nSearching for a full-service and experienced excavation contractor? VTF Excavation offers a wide range of reliable services to meet the needs of your next state, local, or private project.\nLearn More\nDairy Farm & Learning Center\nFor a unique and ag educational experience, visit the Dairy Learning Center located at MVP Dairy , a 4,500 head, state-of-the-art dairy farm owned in partnership between the McCarty and VanTilburg families.\nLearn More\nJoin Our Team\nApply Today\nContact Us\n8398 Celina-Mendon Road, Celina Ohio 45822\nVanTilburg@VanTilburgFarms.com\n419-586-3077\nSubmit\nThanks for submitting!\n©2020 by VanTilburg Farms.\nbottom of page",
